### List input sets
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/input-set?pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1

### Get input set by id
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/input-set/{{inputSetId}} HTTP/1.1

### Create input set (response includes ruleHash per ruleType when clientRulesIds are set)
POST http://localhost:7015/api/v1/input-set HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer styling pack",
  "client": "BZT",
  "createdBy": "admin",
  "clientRulesIds": [],
  "exampleImageIds": []
}

### Update draft input set
PUT http://localhost:7015/api/v1/input-set/{{inputSetId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer styling pack",
  "client": "BZT",
  "createdBy": "admin",
  "clientRulesIds": [],
  "exampleImageIds": []
}

### Archive input set
DELETE http://localhost:7015/api/v1/input-set/{{inputSetId}} HTTP/1.1

### List input sets by status
GET http://localhost:7015/api/v1/input-set?status=archive&pageNum=1&pageSize=20 HTTP/1.1
